    },
    "SURFACE_RULED": {
      "description": "Ruled surface — straight-line ruling outward from selected edges. Type controls tangent_to_surface / normal_to_surface / tapered_to_vector / perpendicular_to_vector / sweep. Distance / Angle drive the ruling magnitude.",
